"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"**Placă nouă:** OpenMV AE3 SBL2 (Alif Ensemble E3), o țintă "
"ascunsă/programată prin DFU programată prin ``alif_tools`` cu accelerare NPU"
" Ethos-U55 cu două nuclee."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** NPU compiler: 4.2.0 -> 5.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS arm64),"
" reinstalled against the Python 3.13 ABI."
msgstr ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** compilator NPU: 4.2.0 -> 5.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS "
"arm64), reinstalat pentru ABI-ul Python 3.13."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:72
msgid ""
"**ST Edge AI** (``stedgeai``) tools: 3.0.0 -> 4.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS "
"arm64)."
msgstr ""
"**ST Edge AI** (\\ ``stedgeai``\\ ) instrumente: 3.0.0 -> 4.0.0 (Windows, "
"Linux, macOS arm64)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:74
